# Bounding Felidar: "Whenever this creature attacks while saddled, put a +1/+1 counter on each other creature you control. You gain 1 life
# for each of those creatures." (CR 702.171b, 122.1, 608.2c). Turn 1: Felidar (6 mana from Black Lotus and three Moxen) and Ornithopter. Turn 3:
# Savannah Lions (a 2/1) taps to saddle it (CR 702.171a: power 2 or more), Felidar attacks, and the trigger puts a counter on Lions (3/2) and on
# Ornithopter (1/3), not on Felidar (still 4/7) and not on Bot2's Isamaru (still 2/2). Two creatures got a counter, so Bot1 gains 2 (20 to 22). Felidar
# connects for 4 (Bot2 20 to 16).

